  "post_title": "Oriol Nebot Herrera gana los 2.000 euros de la campaña de Navidad de Onda Centre Comercial",
  "post_date": "2018-01-08 23:28:00",
  "post_name": "oriol-nebot-navarro-gana-los-2-000-euros-de-la-campana-de-navidad-de-onda-centre-comercial",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Economía|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p>(24 fotos) Oriol Nebot Herrera ha ganado los 2.000 euros del primer premio de la campa&ntilde;a de Navidad de Onda Cente Comercial con una papeleta sellada en Iluminaci&oacute;n Navarro, tras el sorteo celebrado la tarde-noche de este jueves en el Local de Asociaciones de La Safona.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/01/IMG_8400.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Ha extra&iacute;do las papeletas de la suerte Anna Villa Mart&iacute;, hija de la presidenta de la asociaci&oacute;n, Ana Mart&iacute; Olucha, tambi&eacute;n presente en el acto junto a su secretario adjunto, Ram&oacute;n Jord&aacute;n Cameselle.&nbsp;Tambi&eacute;n se han sorteado 20 premios de 200 euros cada uno, seg&uacute;n la relaci&oacute;n de la imagen de abajo.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2018/01/PremisCampanyaNadalOndaCentreComercial.png\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 347px;\" /></p>\n<p>Los premios se entregar&aacute;n este jueves, 11 de enero, a las 20.30 horas en el sal&oacute;n de actos de la primera planta de la Casa de Cultura.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc17/img_8398.jpg\" alt=\"img_8398\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc17/img_8400.jpg\" alt=\"img_8400\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc17/img_8401.jpg\" alt=\"img_8401\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc17/img_8402.jpg\" alt=\"img_8402\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc17/img_8403.jpg\" alt=\"img_8403\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc17/img_8404.jpg\" alt=\"img_8404\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc17/img_8405.jpg\" alt=\"img_8405\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc17/img_8406.jpg\" alt=\"img_8406\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc17/img_8407.jpg\" alt=\"img_8407\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc17/img_8409.jpg\" alt=\"img_8409\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc17/img_8410.jpg\" alt=\"img_8410\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc17/img_8411.jpg\" alt=\"img_8411\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc17/img_8412.jpg\" alt=\"img_8412\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc17/img_8413.jpg\" alt=\"img_8413\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc17/img_8414.jpg\" alt=\"img_8414\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc17/img_8415.jpg\" alt=\"img_8415\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc17/img_8416.jpg\" alt=\"img_8416\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc17/img_8418.jpg\" alt=\"img_8418\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc17/img_8419.jpg\" alt=\"img_8419\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc17/img_8420.jpg\" alt=\"img_8420\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc17/img_8421.jpg\" alt=\"img_8421\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc17/img_8422.jpg\" alt=\"img_8422\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc17/img_8423.jpg\" alt=\"img_8423\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sorteigcampanyanadalocc17/premiscampanyanadalondacentrecomercial.png\" alt=\"premiscampanyanadalondacentrecomercial\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
